    "pack": "Chapter Approved 2026-2027",
    "card": "primary",
    "summary": "Whenever a friendly unit **destroys** another unit, it becomes a **consecration** unit.\n\nAs your turn ends, you may pick 1 **[objective](vsdata:core-rule/objectives)** per **consecration** unit of yours: one in range of that unit, other than your **home objective**, and not yet **consecrated**. For each pick:\n\n- Set an operation marker of yours in range of the picked objective.\n- The objective becomes **consecrated**.\n- The unit the pick was made for stops being a **consecration** unit.",
